.TH "YAMLR-FEATURES" "1" "May 2026" "Yamlr Manual" "User Commands"
.SH "NAME"
yamlr-features \- Propose repairs and remediate Kubernetes manifests.
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
\fBCapability Discovery & Roadmap Matrix\fR
.PP
The \fByamlr features\fR command provides a comprehensive inventory of all engine capabilities, their tiers (Free vs. Pro), and their current activation status.
.PP
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
.RS
# Display the full capability matrix
yamlr features
.RE
.fi
.SH "THE TIERED ENGINE"
Yamlr classifies features into four strategic categories:
.PP
.SS "1. Core (FREE)"
Fundamental safety operations available to the community.
.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fBSchema Validation\fR: OpenAPI-driven audit.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fBVisual Healing\fR: Interactive, comment-preserving repair.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fBAPI Deprecation\fR: Detecting legacy K8s versions.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fBForensic Journal\fR: Atomic WAL journaling of all mutation attempts.
.SS "2. Observability (FREE)"
Visual context and relational awareness.
.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fBRelational Topology\fR: \fBgraph topo\fR - ASCII resource trees.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fBBlast Radius\fR: \fBgraph blast-radius\fR - Impact analysis.
.SS "3. Surgical (FREE/PRO)"
High-precision remediations and GitOps protections.
.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fBAuto-Injection\fR: Injecting limits, probes, and namespaces (Free).
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fBTag Sanitization\fR: Remediating \fB:latest\fR image tags (Free).
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fBClinical Mode\fR: \fB--clinical\fR - Protecting GitOps pipes by redirecting UI to stderr (Free).
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fBRust Acceleration\fR: \fB--fast\fR - Native engine for hyperscale (Pro).
.SS "4. Enterprise (PRO)"
Advanced security, compliance, and strategic integrations.
.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fBDrift Remediation\fR: Reconciling live cluster state with local manifests.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fBAuto-Hardening\fR: Autonomous PSS-style policy injection.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fBSemantic DNA\fR: SHA-256 identity for manifest integrity.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fBEvidence Receipts\fR: DNA-signed PDF receipts for auditors.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fBAI Agent Bridge (MCP)\fR: High-fidelity healing server for LLMs.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fBEnterprise IDE (LSP)\fR: Real-time safety guard in VS Code.
---
.PP
.IP "\fBTIP:\fR" 4
Use \fByamlr features\fR to quickly check if your enterprise license is active and which "Surgical" capabilities are available in your current environment.
.PP
